264	\subsection{Per-Pathogen Best Method Analysis}
265	\label{subsec:9pathogen_best_combos}
266	
267	The central question of Stage 2 is whether the same scoring--detection combination performs best across all pathogens, or whether each pathogen requires a different optimal combination.
268	The best scoring--detection combination was selected for each of the 11 pathogens based on MCC, and \textbf{all 11/11 pathogens exhibited distinct best combinations} (Table~\ref{tab:stage2_best}).
